Directory for GHOST builds using CMake

To compile from this directory, do:
cmake ..
make

You can also build in parallel using, e.g., "make -j4".

If libraries are not in the path, use -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH
and -DFFTW3_ROOT to set paths, e.g., from this directory do

cmake .. -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/foo/openmpi-5.0.8 -DFFTW3_ROOT=/foo/fftw-3.3.10
make

For a clean build, you can do (only in this directory)

rm -rf *
